# Agent-facing source travels with the repository; the rest of .claude/ is
# this machine's runtime (worktrees, launch configuration). A directory that
# is itself excluded cannot have its contents re-included, so exclude the
# children and name the two that are source.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/workflows/
AGENTS.local.md

